          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Get in touch with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — whole-person, integrative care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Book a consult or ask a question.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1:#fffaf6;\\n      --bg-2:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8fff7 0%,#fff7ff 100%);\\n      --accent:#7b6cff;\\n      --muted:#556067;\\n      --card:#ffffff;\\n      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --radius:18px;\\n      --max-width:1080px;\\n      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(34,50,70,0.08);\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg-2);color:#0f1720;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    /* Split diagonal layout */\\n    .wrap{min-height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:center;padding:48px 20px}\\n    .canvas{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}\\n\\n    /* Diagonal panel */\\n    .promo{\\n      position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) + 6px);background:var(--card);padding:48px 40px 56px 56px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);\\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 85% 100%, 0% 100%);\\n    }\\n    .right{\\n      align-self:start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;position:relative\\n    }\\n\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,36px);line-height:1.03;color:#081127}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}\\n\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(123,108,255,0.12),rgba(123,108,255,0.06));color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* subtle SVG texture */\\n    .texture{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}\\n    .texture svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\\n\\n    /* contact card */\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,255,255,0.85));backdrop-filter: blur(6px);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(12,30,40,0.06)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#16304a;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,22,33,0.06);font-size:14px;background:white;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5fb5ff);color:white;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    .small-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .small-list b{font-weight:700;color:#10304a}\\n\\n    /* social proof */\\n    .trust{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}\\n    .logo-dot{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f8faff);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n\\n    /* map placeholder */\\n    .map{height:160px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,20,40,0.02),rgba(7,20,40,0.01));border:1px dashed rgba(7,20,40,0.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n\\n    /* small footer CTA */\\n    .contact-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    a.link{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .canvas{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\\n      .promo{clip-path:none;padding:28px}\\n      .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"canvas\\\">\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"promo\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-title\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"texture\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <!-- Inline unique SVG pattern (playful + premium) -->\\n          <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e9f7f1\\\" />\\n                <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f7f2ff\\\" />\\n              </linearGradient>\\n              <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(15)\\\">\\n                <rect width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"8\\\" r=\\\"2.8\\\" fill=\\\"#cfdfff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\" fill=\\\"#bfece4\\\" opacity=\\\"0.95\\\" />\\n              </pattern>\\n              <filter id=\\\"soft\\\" x=\\\"-50%\\\" y=\\\"-50%\\\" width=\\\"200%\\\" height=\\\"200%\\\">\\n                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"18\\\" result=\\\"b\\\" />\\n                <feBlend in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" in2=\\\"b\\\" mode=\\\"screen\\\" />\\n              </filter>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n            <g filter=\\\"url(#soft)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.8\\\">\\n              <ellipse cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" rx=\\\"90\\\" ry=\\\"34\\\" fill=\\\"#7b6cff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n              <ellipse cx=\\\"480\\\" cy=\\\"300\\\" rx=\\\"220\\\" ry=\\\"70\\\" fill=\\\"#5fb5ff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.04\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"position:relative;z-index:2;\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Reach {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <h1 id=\\\"contact-title\\\">Let's make a plan for your whole health</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Friendly, evidence-informed integrative care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Whether you have a specific concern or want a guided reset, we focus on lifestyle, labs (optional), and a stepwise plan you can live with.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"logo-dot\\\">HM</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small-list\\\">\\n                <span style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Open to new patients &mdash; flexible telehealth options</span>\\n                <span style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Care led by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"reach-title\\\">\\n              <h3 id=\\\"reach-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px\\\">Call or Email</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"contact-meta\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Phone</div>\\n                <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</div>\\n                <a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px\\\">Location & Hours</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Mon &ndash; Fri: 9:00am &ndash; 5:00pm<br/>Sat: By appointment</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"map\\\">Map / telehealth info</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"right\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"form-title\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"form-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px\\\">Send a note</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px\\\">Tell us a bit about why you're reaching out. No medical advice here; this starts a conversation about care options.</p>\\n\\n          <form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\" style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px\\\"> \\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Mobile or preferred\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"reason\\\">Reason (brief)</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n                <option>New patient consult</option>\\n                <option>Follow-up / ongoing care</option>\\n                <option>Lab review</option>\\n                <option>Billing / insurance</option>\\n                <option>Other</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n              <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us what matters most right now...\\\"></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n              <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Send message</button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"font-size:12px;margin-top:8px\\\">We will respond within 2 business days. For urgent medical matters please call local emergency services.</div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px\\\">How we help</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Educational visits, individualized plans, lifestyle support, and optional lab-informed suggestions. No guarantees — just clear steps to better balance.</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Learn about our approach →</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px\\\">Meet the clinician</h4>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Blends conventional testing with nutrition, movement, and stress tools. Focus on evidence and what fits your life.</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"link\\\" href=\\\"about.html\\\">Read bio →</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <nav style=\\\"max-width:var(--max-width);margin:28px auto 0;display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">What We Do</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Common Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Our Way</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Plans</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Meet</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"link\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">Reach Us</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact.html\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a short README to integrate into the holistic_medicine site (split_diagonal layout, playful_premium voice).\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — a self-contained contact page with inline SVG texture and split-diagonal visual treatment. The page is responsive, accessible, and uses only CSS + inline SVG (no external assets).\\n\\nPlaceholders you must replace at deploy-time:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nNotes for integration:\\n- This chunk intentionally inlines its decorative SVG pattern and uses clip-path for the diagonal panel so no external images are required.\\n- Navigation labels were varied to fit the playful_premium tone: \\\"What We Do\\\", \\\"Our Way\\\", \\\"Meet\\\", \\\"Reach Us\\\". Ensure site-wide nav uses slightly different wording per template.\\n- The contact form uses a mailto POST fallback (mailto:{{EMAIL}}). For production use swap the form action to your chosen backend endpoint or attach JS for form handling / validation.\\n- Compliance: content avoids promises of cures and emphasizes education and a whole-person approach.\\n- Accessibility: semantic headings, labels tied to inputs, and clear ARIA-ready IDs are provided.\\n\\nIntegration tips:\\n- Drop contact.html into the root alongside the other templates (index.html, services.html, etc.).\\n- If you maintain a central assets folder, you can extract the inline SVG into assets/img/pattern.svg for reuse — update the page to reference it as background-image or <img> as desired.\\n- Keep {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} consistent across pages to point users to the booking flow (book.html or booking provider).\\n\\nDesign rationale summary:\\n- Split diagonal panel creates a premium, energetic composition that feels both approachable and curated.\\n- Inline pattern gives visual richness without external dependencies, matching the playful_premium voice used across the theme.\\n- The right column focuses on immediate action (form + contact info) while the left diagonal area provides context and social proof.\\n\\nIf you want a sister file that extracts the SVG to assets/img/pattern.svg or a server-ready contact handler (POST endpoint), ask and I will provide the additional files.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
